
@startuml
title Student Registration System - MVC

actor User
participant "StudentView\n(View)" as View
participant "StudentController\n(Controller)" as Controller
participant "Student\n(Model)" as Model

User -> View: Enter student ID and name
User -> View: Click "Register Student"

View -> Controller: Button click event
activate Controller

Controller -> View: getStudentId()
View --> Controller: Student ID

Controller -> View: getStudentName()
View --> Controller: Student name

Controller -> Model: setStudent(id, name)
activate Model
Model --> Controller: Data stored
deactivate Model

Controller -> Model: getId() / getName()
Model --> Controller: Student information

Controller -> View: showResult(id + " - " + name)
View --> User: Display registered student

deactivate Controller
@enduml
